{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2021-06-09 14:03:00', 'title': 'LMC ANNOUNCES TOPPING OUT OF OVATION APARTMENT COMMUNITY', 'text': 'SEATTLE, JUNE 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 LMC , A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LENNAR CORPORATION AND A LEADER IN APARTMENT DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE TOPPING OUT OF OVATION, A LUXURY TWO-TOWER HIGH-RISE AND MIXED-USE APARTMENT COMMUNITY LOCATED AT THE GATEWAY TO THE FIRST HILL NEIGHBORHOOD OF SEATTLE.\xa0 THE TOPPING OUT SYMBOLIZES A MILESTONE IN THE CONSTRUCTION PROCESS FOR THE 32-STORY TOWERS, WHICH FEATURE 548 APARTMENT HOMES AND 6,000 SQUARE FEET OF RETAIL AND OFFICE SPACE.'}